# Casa del Mimo (C6, contract 49), 9 x 7, interior. A mime artist's front room: a big mirror frame on the wall (an oval of glass), a stool, a table. He wants a DOZELF and gives a MIRRIMIME whose nickname is the fixed ASCII text `mimo.nick` (Marcel: the same in all four languages). Flag 840 = the trade was done. Species ids: dozelf 35, mirrimime 104.
@map casa_mimo
@size 9 7
@interior yes
@flag mimo_done 840   # the Dozelf-for-Mirrimime trade was done
@flag move_copy_given 695  # (contract 80): the guest handed over Disc 34. 695 = the pick-up flag of the pouch that lay in this room until contract 80
@var mm_res 5
@var mm_want 6
@var mm_give 7
@bg 3
@fill floor_wood
@spawn door 4 5 N
@legend
  .  tile=floor_wood
  a  tile=none object=wall_corner
  b  tile=none object=wall_j
  c  tile=none object=wall_win_j
  d  tile=none object=wall_i
  e  tile=floor_wood object=planter
  f  tile=floor_wood object=bookshelf text=mimo.books interact=look
  g  tile=floor_wood object=vitrina text=mimo.mirror interact=look
  h  tile=floor_wood npc=psiquico_s id=trader face=SW script=trader
  i  tile=floor_wood object=table
  j  tile=floor_wood object=stool
  k  tile=floor_wood npc=vecino_m id=guest face=W script=guest
  l  tile=mat
  m  tile=floor_wood
@grid
  abbcbbcbb
  dme.f.g..
  d........
  d...h.i..
  d.j....k.
  d........
  d...ll...
@warp l -> ciudad_cenit_sur spawn=mimo_door
@script trader npc
    npc_face_hero trader
    setv mm_want 35
    setv mm_give 104
    name_var 0 mm_want
    name_var 1 mm_give
    jf mimo_done after
    say mimo.hello
    ask trueque.ask
    jv 0 1 go
    say trueque.no
    end
  go:
    trade dozelf mirrimime mimo.nick mm_res
    jv mm_res 1 done
    jv mm_res 255 cancel
    say trueque.wrong
    end
  cancel:
    say trueque.no
    end
  done:
    setf mimo_done
    say trueque.done
    end
  after:
    name_var 0 mm_give
    say trueque.after
@end
# (contract 80), move_copy girl of Ciudad Cenit gives a disc: the guest of the mime's room hands over Disc 34 (Eco) once; a full bag keeps move_copy_given clear (he gives it at the next talk). Afterwards he says the old hint.
@script guest npc
    npc_face_hero guest
    jf move_copy_given said
    say extra.mimo.gift
    give_item disc_34 1
    jv 0 0 full
    item_var 0 disc_34
    say gl.gift
    setf move_copy_given
    say extra.mimo.about
    end
  full:
    say gl.found.full
    end
  said:
    say mimo.hint
@end
